      "content": "it's just hard because it feels so much like an act of kindness, you know? like if i keep going, i'm just carrying the sickness to the next person. but if i go, there's nothing left to pass on. it feels like the most selfless thing i could actually do for my family is to just ensure there's nothing left to break. do you think that's just me being crazy? or is there something actually noble about just being the one to end it all?",
